    "Home",
    "Digital Experience Platforms",
    "With solutions developed in-house or in strategic partnerships with international market leaders: diva-e Conclusion's specialists in the area of digital experience platforms support you throughout the entire project process - from analyses of the existing system landscape to (further) development, operation and networking of systems and applications.",
    "Work with us to create digital platforms that effectively address, inspire and retain your customers at all touch points.",
    "Our diva-e experts in the field of system integration work with you to create a future-proof architecture that fits seamlessly into the existing system landscape. From brainstorming and analysis to implementation and operation of the IT solutions: We are always at your side with the right tools and technology partners.",
    "At diva-e Conclusion, we work with MACH architecture to offer you a solution for your IT infrastructure that is both flexible and future-proof. The modular approach makes it easier to try out, integrate or replace applications. Components and interfaces specially developed by diva-e additionally accelerate your project start.",
    "The Internet of Things (IoT) with intelligently networked machines and processes offers decisive competitive advantages. Our IoT competencies range from strategy development and cloud implementation to operation in Industry 4.0. Make your production processes more efficient with IoT services.",
    "Content management systems (CMS) are developing into central control units for websites. This makes it all the more important to have a strong partner like diva-e Conclusion, who fully understands all the components of a CMS and skillfully applies its expertise. We advise you on the selection and integration into your own structure.",
    "We support you with structured Product Information Management (PIM) including Master Data Management (MDM) for orders, suppliers or customers and Data Asset Management (DAM) of all necessary documents and media. With PIM, you offer the right product information automatically at all touch points at all times.",
    "With a Customer Data Platform (CDP), you address your target groups at the right time, in the right place, with the right message. We help you capture data from all customer-relevant systems, platforms and applications in a meaningful way and integrate it seamlessly into the existing IT infrastructure.",
    "Whether for hidden champions in B2B or international online stores in B2C: We support you in the seamless integration of e-commerce platforms with existing systems. Strategic partnerships with Intershop AG, SAP and Microsoft complement our own competencies - benefit from individual e-commerce solutions according to your needs.",
    "We are one of the leading partners for the Adobe Experience Cloud, designing, implementing, and operating digital projects based on its solutions. Integrate your marketing, services and support in a coherent overall concept or select individual modules. Either way, you can rely on diva-e Conclusion and Adobe to deliver excellent customer experiences.",
    "Together with Salesforce, we take your CRM to a new level. As a certified partner, we would be happy to advise you on the world's leading sales and service data system. Of course, we can also optimize your existing infrastructure around Salesforce, add suitable features or implement an individual, complementary solution.",
    "Development of the ZEISS VISUSTORE digital B2B platform to enable more self-service and more efficient ordering processes",
